{"articleNo":"196952","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=196952&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[선발완료][근로]국가근로 모집 안내(창의지식재산센터)[선발완료]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.08.28","hit":"4568","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><font color=\"#050099\">우리대학교 산학협력단 운영시설인 \"창의지식재산센터\"</font></strong>에서 </font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#000000\">학기 중에 근무할 국가근로 학생을 모집합니다.</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#050099\">- 2018-2학기 국가근로 자격을 갖춘 재학생 중 1순위만 신청 가능합니다.</font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#050099\">- 성실하게 근무할 학생을 원합니다.</font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#050099\">- 선착순 선발 아닙니다. 신청기간 후 선발기준에 따라 선발합니다.</font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#050099\">- 다른 근로와 중복지원 안됩니다.</font></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"